td><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0.3em; padding-bottom: 0.3em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0.3em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0.3em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr></mjx-itable></mjx-table></mjx-mtable></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.6em 0.6em 0.6em 0.6em 0.6em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>10</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5.</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Finally, position vector <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"62\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D429 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">p</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of the intersection point <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"63\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is obtained by substituting <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"64\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"tru